+|---|---|
+| `93e1f6a7`, RC49 | Project edit has `kind: uniform_equipment_texture`, `asset_id`, `png`. An ordinary PNG requests the then-supported palette recolour. There was no independent-chain intent to reconstruct at RC49. |
